$ todo done 2
done 2: call the plumber
$ todo show
 1 [-] buy milk
 2 [x] call the plumber
 3 [-] water plants
$ todo done 7
todo: no item 7 (exit 3)
$ todo done two
todo: `two` is not an item number (exit 4)
$ todo clear
cleared 1 done
$ todo rm 1
removed 1: buy milk
$ todo show
 1 [-] water plants
$ todo add
todo: usage: add TEXT (exit 2)
$ todo fly
